@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-89890
+notes:
+  mod_forum:
+    - message: >-
+        The view and manage subscribers selector of the
+        `mod_forum/forum_subscription_action` template is now rendered as a
+        tertiary navigation selector (`core/tertiary_navigation_selector`) using
+        the new `viewandmanageselectmenu` context variable, which holds
+        `core\output\select_menu` data. Theme overrides of this template should
+        be updated to use it.
+      type: changed
